nup how auto passes headers\n* #1709: nes: refactor: more sane way to tweak response format\n* #1705: update cache\n* #1703: chore: bump engine to fix compat with core after https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/pull/274025\n* #1702: Bring back completion panel.\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=369727&view=logs).</details>"}}